---
import Head from '../components/Head.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<Head />
		<title>Nick Cosmo</title>
	</head>
	<body class="dark">
		<Header />
		<main id="main-content" class="pb-16">
			<div class="content grid grid-cols-8 gap-x-4 m-4">
				<div class="col-span-8 md:col-span-2 mt-2">
					<h2>Freelance web developer with a focus on improving accessibility.</h2>
					<ul role="list" class="list-inside list-disc mt-5 mb-5">
						<li>CMS specialist since 2008</li>
						<li>Lead developer & Project manager on hundreds of projects</li>
						<li>Accessibility Remediation Specialist / Engineer</li>
						<li>Specialised Legacy / CMS → Modern Static Migration + Performance Specialist</li>
					</ul>
					<p>Recent work has focused on auditing and remediating accessibility issues in CMS-based websites, improving WCAG compliance and overall user experience.</p>
					<p>&nbsp;</p>
					<p>CV: <a target="_blank" href="/Nick_Halstead_CV.pdf">Download my CV</a></p>
					<h2>My Evaluation Stack & Testing Methodology</h2>
					<p>&nbsp;</p>
					<p>I do not rely blindly on automated scanners. My rigorous manual testing matrix ensures comprehensive barrier identification:</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Automated Baselines: Axe-core CLI, Accessibility Insights for Web, and WAVE.</li>
						<li>Screen Reader Testing: NVDA on Windows 11 (Chrome/Edge).</li>
						<li>Manual Inspection: Full keyboard-only pathing, visible focus state checking, 400% browser zoom reflow validation, and high-contrast color contrast analysis via TPGi CCA.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div class="col-span-8 md:col-span-2 mt-2">
					<h2>Selected Clients</h2>
					<p><a target="_blank" href="https://www.charliehill.org.uk">Charlie Hill</a></p>
					<p><a target="_blank" href="https://www.mgmoves.co.uk/">MG Moves</a></p>
					<p><a target="_blank" href="https://www.mequinenzadreamfishing.co.uk/">Mequinenza Dream Fishing</a></p>
					<p><a target="_blank" href="https://ebro-expert.com/">Ebro Expert</a></p>
					<p><a target="_blank" href="https://www.jameshood.com/">James Hood</a></p>
					<p><a target="_blank" href="https://www.poseidonmusic.com/">Poseidon Music</a></p>
					<p><a target="_blank" href="https://offthewallstainedglass.com/">Off The Wall</a></p>
					<p><a target="_blank" href="https://www.julianbarnesangling.com/">Julian Barnes</a></p>
					<p><a target="_blank" href="https://www.butebaptists.org.uk/">Bute Baptists</a></p>
					<p><a target="_blank" href="https://www.northfieldfestival.org.uk/">Northfield Festival</a></p>
					<p><a target="_blank" href="https://www.piefingers.net/">Piefingers</a></p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
